---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";

const seo = {
  page_description: "Terms of Service for IBS-Go.",
  canonical_url: "/legal/terms/",
  no_index: true,
};
---
<Layout title="Terms of Service | IBS-Go" seo={seo}>
  <main class="container-narrow py-16 prose prose-lg">
    <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
    <p>Last Updated: October 2024</p>

    <h2>1. Not Medical Advice</h2>
    <p>IBS-Go is a tracking and analytics tool designed to help you identify patterns. It is not a diagnostic tool, nor is it a replacement for professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. Always seek the advice of your physician or a qualified health provider with any questions you may have regarding a medical condition.</p>

    <h2>2. App Usage</h2>
    <p>You agree to use the app for its intended purpose. The FODMAP data provided is based on publicly available scientific literature and is subject to change as research evolves. We do not guarantee the absolute accuracy of the stacking calculator for your specific biological response.</p>
  </main>
</Layout>
